WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.937 --> 00:00:15.883
"I have to get to Mrs. Bun's house," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:15.883 --> 00:00:20.070
"Someone robbed her guests!"

3
00:00:20.071 --> 00:00:26.473
"I'll be right back! I need to call my parents." Roxy yelled to her friends.

4
00:00:26.473 --> 00:00:32.105
"Don't take too long," Terrell said. "The concert is starting soon."

5
00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:35.948
A moment later Roxy shot up into the sky.

6
00:00:35.948 --> 00:00:41.946
"Whoa!" Mara cried. "Rocket Girl!"

7
00:00:41.947 --> 00:00:45.690
Roxy arrived at Mrs. Bun's house.

8
00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:50.748
Mrs. Bun looked upset as Detective Smith crawled around in some rosebushes.

9
00:00:50.748 --> 00:00:57.290
Roxy grinned. "Doing some gardening, Detective?"

10
00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:02.415
"Ha-ha, Rocket Girl." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

11
00:01:02.415 --> 00:01:06.222
"I—ouch! A thorn poked me."

12
00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:09.593
He got back to his feet and held up his notebook.

13
00:01:09.593 --> 00:01:12.264
"I dropped this in the rosebushes."

14
00:01:12.265 --> 00:01:16.936
The detective turned to Mrs. Bun. "I'm sorry. What were you saying?"

15
00:01:16.936 --> 00:01:19.479
Mrs. Bun took a deep breath.

16
00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:22.417
"I was telling you about my guests.

17
00:01:22.418 --> 00:01:25.738
They are all still here if you want to talk to them.

18
00:01:25.738 --> 00:01:29.531
The servers and the quartet are here too."

19
00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:33.375
"Quartet?" Detective Smith raised an eyebrow.

20
00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:37.123
"A string quartet," Mrs. Bun said.

21
00:01:37.123 --> 00:01:41.777
"I hired four musicians to play during the party."

22
00:01:41.778 --> 00:01:45.150
"What happened before the robbery?" Roxy asked.

23
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:48.689
"Did you see anything suspicious?"

24
00:01:48.689 --> 00:01:50.548
Mrs. Bun shrugged.

25
00:01:50.548 --> 00:01:54.531
"It's odd, but I don't remember anything.

26
00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:58.058
One minute we were enjoying a lovely afternoon.

27
00:01:58.058 --> 00:02:04.818
And the next minute, everyone's wallets were missing! Our jewelry too!"

28
00:02:04.818 --> 00:02:07.940
Detective Smith made some notes.

29
00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:11.658
"We'll need to interview everyone, Mrs. Bun."

30
00:02:11.659 --> 00:02:14.679
Roxy spotted the musicians.

31
00:02:14.679 --> 00:02:21.352
"Let's start with them."

32
00:02:21.352 --> 00:02:26.840
"Did anybody see anything suspicious?" Roxy asked the musicians.

33
00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.185
"No," the cellist said.

34
00:02:29.185 --> 00:02:31.252
"But I hope you find the criminal.

35
00:02:31.252 --> 00:02:34.091
That thief stole my new watch."

36
00:02:34.091 --> 00:02:39.923
He looked at his cello and sighed. "I'm just glad I still have this."

37
00:02:39.923 --> 00:02:45.551
"My ruby earrings are gone!" a violinist said.

38
00:02:45.551 --> 00:02:49.018
"Wait a second," Detective Smith said.

39
00:02:49.018 --> 00:02:55.651
"There are only three of you. Mrs. Bun said you were a quartet."

40
00:02:55.652 --> 00:03:01.882
"Oh, goodness!" the third musician said. "Where's Violet?"

41
00:03:01.882 --> 00:03:04.077
"Who?" Roxy asked.

42
00:03:04.077 --> 00:03:10.038
"Violet Sharp," the cellist said. "She's our other violinist."

43
00:03:10.038 --> 00:03:12.261
"Hmm," Roxy said.

44
00:03:12.261 --> 00:03:16.181
"Someone robbed the guests, and now Violet is gone.

45
00:03:16.181 --> 00:03:19.069
That's pretty suspicious."

46
00:03:19.069 --> 00:03:22.171
"Nonsense," the violinist said.

47
00:03:22.171 --> 00:03:26.615
"Violet is no thief. She's a very talented musician.

48
00:03:26.615 --> 00:03:32.536
In fact, the Metro City Symphony Orchestra invited her to try out."

49
00:03:32.536 --> 00:03:35.589
"Impressive," Detective Smith said.

50
00:03:35.589 --> 00:03:38.603
Then his phone beeped.

51
00:03:38.603 --> 00:03:43.739
"Hello? Oh no! We'll be right there!"

52
00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.799
He hung up and looked at Roxy.

53
00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.127
"Another robbery just took place.

54
00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:54.128
This one was at Metro City Shopping Mall!"
